{"quest_id": 4359, "name": "紅の霧の脅威", "description": "視界を遮り、魔物たちを活性化させる\n紅の霧の脅威に耐え、魔物たちを倒せ！\n＜特定のタイミングで紅の霧が発生＞\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "modifier_notes": ["特定のタイミングで紅の霧が発生"], "event": "風水士と紅の教団", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920049, "map_no": 3605, "level": 95, "multiplier": 0.95, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 14, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 950, "attack": 142, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097632, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 35, "global_id": 34, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1425, "attack": 142, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 133, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097664, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 37, "global_id": 36, "spawn_sec": 23}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1140, "attack": 266, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 280, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 80, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 109, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097696, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 39, "global_id": 38, "spawn_sec": 25}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2850, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101536, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 316, "global_id": 315, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 36}], "popups": ["　　　悪天候：紅の霧\n\n・敵味方の『射程』減少\n・敵の『移動速度』上昇\n・一部の味方は影響を受けない"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、領内にて魔物たちの襲撃が相次いでいるとの\n報告が入りました。", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "目撃した兵士の情報では、襲撃時にはいずれも\n赤味を帯びた霧が発生し、どうやらその霧が\n魔物たちを活性化させているとのことです。", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "警護している兵士たちも苦戦しているようで……。\nこれは魔物たちが何かよからぬことを\nたくらんでいるのかもしれません。", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "報告！　魔物の軍勢がこちらに向かってきています！", "face": "l6852db1335ce"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 37, "lines": [{"name": "教団員", "text": "やっと出てきたな……。\n我が主、魔神ロノベ様の紅の霧を\nとくと味わうがいい！", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 39, "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "これが紅の霧！", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "報告によると、この霧は視界を遮るだけでなく、\n魔物を活性化させるとのことです。", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "どうかお気を付けください。", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "教団員", "text": "くっ……。さすがに手強いな。\nだが、一刻も早く魔神ロノベ様を\n蘇らせなければ……。", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "魔神ロノベ……？\n一体なんのことでしょうか……。", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "魔神ロノベは、かつて地上を荒らした\n魔神の一柱です。", "face": "u275"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "不死身を誇った魔神ですが、伝説の英雄に\nその身を砕かれ封印された……。", "face": "u275"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "教団はどうやら、その魔神を蘇らせようと\nしているようです。", "face": "u275"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "しかし、魔神ロノベの信徒を簡単に退ける\nなんて、流石は伝説の英雄の末裔ですね。", "face": "u275"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あなたは一体……。", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920049_3605", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 41, "y": 380}, {"k": "m", "x": 809, "y": 361, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 708, "y": 371, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 605, "y": 353, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 512, "y": 330, 